# --- Bioequivalence engine ---
#
# The calculator of record, and the qualified source of FDA's Appendix C model
# statements. The SAS validation package generator reads those statements from
# `be_stats.replicate_abe.APPENDIX_C_MODEL` rather than retyping them, so the
# program a customer runs cannot drift from the specification it claims to
# implement.
#
# The dependency is one-directional and stays that way: be-stats imports no
# web, database or LLM code, and above all no SAS. Installed from the path so
# the engine keeps its own version and qualification cadence.
-e ../be-stats
